[I] Pythonic DBus library without libgi dependency

[T] dasbus is a DBus library written in Python 3, based on GLib and inspired by
[T] pydbus, developed for the Anaconda installer project as a modern
[T] alternative to the older python-dbus bindings.

[U] https://github.com/rhinstaller/dasbus

